  <item>
    <title>05.《重启人生》| 走吧,去冰上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644016aca79cc81470f55277</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644016aca79cc81470f55277</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 16:28:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>早晨六点钟，打开一天的门，我走进生活，一抹年轻的蓝，在窗前问候我</span></p><span></span><p><span>——纳奇姆《六点钟》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;现代人被笼罩在庞大的规则穹顶之下，如履薄冰地生存着，每一步都胆战心惊，害怕踏碎薄冰沉入水底，渐渐的，我们不再去关注清晨门外那一抹蓝，不再听第一声唤醒自己的鸟鸣，也不再关心身边的人。我们要如何自洽的生活在这样冰冷而矛盾的世界中呢，最近大热的日剧《重启人生》用别样、诙谐的故事给予了我们安慰及启发——去拥抱无用的太阳吧，至少能感觉到温暖；去亲近那些具有感知力的人，不再害怕受伤；尝试着跳脱出所谓的规则，从心底获得自由。所以，走吧，去冰上吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 重启人生制作团队简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 编剧“笨蛋节奏”的独特风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a>关于女演员安藤樱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a>重启人生剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a>“上帝是个公务员”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 如果能重启人生,小停和阿存的选择竟然是?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 麻美酱的任务清单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 和高中老师"三田大金刚"的纠葛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a>玲奈酱被小三事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a>守护小生命的诞生——谢谢你来到这个世界上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>另一位“重生”的主角——真理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 夏叽和美宝的性格特点以及四个女孩的美妙情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 被高度肯定的友谊中的陪伴与愉悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 近年影视剧中多种多样的“女性友谊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">42:33</a> 不专业的影视剧“男性友谊”辣评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> 社会中的“男性同盟”是如何摧毁美好友谊的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">49:28</a> 《重启人生》中女性视角下的“女性凝视”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">53:23</a> 编剧对幽默元素的娴熟运用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 面对自我价值存亡危机的当代年轻人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 《重启人生》中乌托邦社会的转世规则与内涵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3984">66:24</a> 跳脱出规则的麻美——挣脱束缚的“善”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4201">70:01</a> 将宏大叙事拉下神坛，宏大与日常并存</span></p><span></span><p><span>【引用】</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《自我决定的孤独》—[德]伊丽莎白·冯·塔登</span></p><span></span><p><span>《变形记》—[古罗马]奥维德</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《瞬息全宇宙》—[美]关家永、丹尼尔·史纳特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的天才女友》—[意]萨维里奥·科斯坦佐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《阳光姐妹淘》—[韩]姜炯哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>《都市女孩》—[美]莉娜·汉纳姆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《亲密》—[比]卢卡斯·德霍特</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Bgm】</span></p><span></span><p><span>僕が一番欲しかったもの—槙原敬之</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kindness Follows—Birds of Norway</span></p><span></span><p><span>なごり雪 —森恵</span></p><span></span><p><span>Riverside—Agnes Obel</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪に咲く花—川岛爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sandals And Sundowns—Cast Of Characters</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于兔子】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：兔子与魔术帽</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：tzymsm@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
