  <item>
    <title>03.《初恋》|我对你除了爱没有其他（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641015e8acc110612a35fe15</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641015e8acc110612a35fe15</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Mar 2023 06:36:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>“我恋爱了，简单到可笑”</span></h2><h2><span>我想为她摘下盛放的丁香花</span></h2><h2><span>想同她一起去吃我最爱的那不勒斯意面</span></h2><h2><span>想搭乘着她一起实现梦想</span></h2><h2><span>她是我的初恋 是命中注定</span></h2><h2><span>只要想起她，我的心就变得完整</span></h2><p><span>&nbsp;喜欢的餐厅会倒闭，记忆会消失，载着人们希望的飞船会变成太空垃圾，曾经的校园初恋会变得面目全非，有什么是不会改变的呢，我想大概是寒冬过后一定会迎来春天。</span></p><p><span> 就这样怀抱着希望一起来听初恋吧～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a>复古的胶片片头与片尾</span></p><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a>“你最喜欢的食物是什么”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a>“两个人成为灵魂伴侣的概率是60亿分之一”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a>年少时的相互陪伴与治愈</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a>戛然而止的初恋</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a>“希望号”脱离轨道迷失在了太空</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a>丁香花指引着也英和晴道的再次相遇</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a>“她就像一只外国品种的猫”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>“洗衣房简直是地狱一般的存在”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a>“让世界看看老鲑鱼的厉害”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a>“所有的相遇与分离都会受到命运的指引”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a>“我已经受够了希望落空的生活”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a>晴道与恒美的感情</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3113">51:53</a>“五感”成就达成，解锁“完整的”也英</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3228">53:48</a>“我的梦想就是让你幸福”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3459">57:39</a> 也英人物分析</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3682">61:22</a> “成功叙事”下的“大女主”</span></h2><h2><span>【BGM】</span></h2><h2><span>宇多田光 - First Love</span></h2><h2><span>Ben Howard - Old Pine (Album)</span></h2><h2><span>Paul Otten - Wear You Down</span></h2><h2><span>岩崎太整 _ Anna Gréta - Hafið Syngur</span></h2><p><span>金采源 - First Love</span></p><h2><span>【关于兔子】</span></h2><h2><span>微博：兔子与魔术帽</span></h2><h2><span>邮箱：tzymsm@163.com</span></h2>]]></description>
