  <item>
    <title>02.《美丽的世界，你在哪里》|我会证明你的存在</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b69fe9da83c49d996a5d10</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b69fe9da83c49d996a5d10</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jan 2023 10:01:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>被剥夺了神道的这个大自然，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不复知道她所赐与的欢欣，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不再沉迷于自己的妙相庄严，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不再认识支配自己的精神，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对我们的幸福不感到高兴，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>甚至不关心艺术家的荣誉，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>就像滴答的摆钟，死气沉沉，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>屈从铁一般的规律。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>为了获得焕然一新的明天，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>她在今天挖好自己的坟墓，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>岁月总是上上下下地旋转，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>绕着一个永远同样的心轴。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>群神悠闲地回到诗歌世界，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>尘世的凡人不再需要他们，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>世人已长大，不再靠神的引带，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>可以自己保持平衡。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他们回去了，他们也同时带回</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一切至美，一切崇高伟大，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一切生命的音响，一切色彩，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>只把没有灵魂的言语留下。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他们获救了，摆脱时间的潮流，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在品都斯山顶上面飘荡；</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>要在诗歌之中永垂不朽，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>必须在人世间灭亡。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>——希腊的群神(节选) [德国]席勒</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;时隔快三个月的一期播客，短短三个月我们的生活却发生了翻天覆地的变化，经历从管控到解封，从感染到康复，我们被生活挟持着前进，逐渐失去控制力，但还好有身边人，有书籍，让我们不至于放弃爱和思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;怀抱着这样的心情我们录制了播客第二期——《美丽的世界，你在哪里》|我会证明你的存在，希望大家喜欢。</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>我们的近况</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a>艾丽斯，与外界真诚又拒绝的沟通方式</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a>当代小说或许正压缩着世界的真相，粉饰着真正的现实</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a>费利克斯，完全接受自己的人是非常强大的</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a>艾丽斯与费利克斯——像水一般不被定义的关系</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a>艾琳，人生的意义在哪里</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a>艾琳与西蒙——介于“神性”与“人性”之间的爱情</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a>玛丽安与康奈尔——我们自以为的“不正常”是组成人生的最重要的一块拼图</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a>三对情侣之间的共性，萨利鲁尼作品中的马克思主义</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2756">45:56</a>看似分散的话题暗藏着链接的断裂与重建</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a>政治性抑郁的定义、过程、影响，结构强势地单向度地影响着个人的命运</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3567">59:27</a>①沉浸到自己的热爱当中去</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3712">61:52</a>②爱身边的人，守好自己的小世界不要崩塌，寻找“附近”</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">62:34</a>③切实地去感受身体的存在，比如：运动</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3817">63:37</a>三个有用但不道德的心态</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3882">64:42</a>心理医生不应该避讳谈论政治问题</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4141">69:01</a> 萨利鲁尼的答案是——性与爱</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4234">70:34</a>资本主义是导致爱欲消亡最根本的原因</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4527">75:27</a>世界末日如同一场忧郁症，而外来行星就是闯入世界的“他者”</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4736">78:56</a>爱欲通过承认“无能为力”来实现</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>【引用】</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>书籍与文章：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《悠悠岁月》-[法]安妮·埃尔诺</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《天堂猎犬》-[英]汤普森·弗朗西斯</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>《苏菲的世界》-[挪威]乔斯坦·贾德</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>《共产党宣言》-[德]卡尔·马克思、弗里德里希·恩格斯</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《政治性抑郁》-[美]罗伯特·罗森</span></p><span></span><p><span>《政治性/结构性抑郁》-SeizeTheDays</span></p><span></span><p><span>《为什么心理治疗师应该谈论政治》-[美]理查德·布鲁耶特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《上学记》-[中]何兆武</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《把自己作为方法》-[中]项彪</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>《爱欲之死》-[德]韩炳哲</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《成为波伏娃》-[法]西蒙·波伏娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧与电影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《正常人》-[爱尔兰]伦尼·阿伯拉罕森</span></p><span></span><p><span>《伦敦生活第二季》-[美]哈利·布拉德比尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>《花束般的恋爱》-[日]土井裕泰</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寻梦环游记》-[美]李·昂克里奇、阿德里安.莫利纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><h2><span>The Wonder of You-Conor O'Brien</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>白热!ゾロ-浜口史郎</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>Small Happiness-麗美 (れいみぃ)</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Remember Me (Lullaby)-Gael Garcia Bernal</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【关于兔子】</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>微博：兔子与魔术帽</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>邮箱：tzymsm@163.com</span></h2>]]></description>
